  "description": "King of the road.\n\nThe Empire is the do-it-all road bike.\n\nEfficient Power Transfer Empire has evolved from our previous gen road bike. Experience a 20.5% better head tube lateral stiffness allowing more confident cornering and better sprinting power. Ride with 15.3% more efficient rear wheel power transfer and a 3% stiffer bottom bracket. Efficiency = Power.\n\nMonoform™ construction\n\nMonoForm™ technology uses a true one-piece carbon molding process to create a frame without the traditional bonded joints found in most carbon bikes. Reducing weak points and excess material, resulting in a frame that is lighter, stronger, and more consistent.\n\nAn Adaptable Ride\n\nGet tires up to 32c, which means more comfortable rides on all road conditions, and up to 3 cages in the front triangle for more hydration or your tool kit.\n\nStrength through technology.\n\nBy using Monoform™ construction – a true 1-piece mold – there is no bonding, no dead spots, and no frame alignment issues. Empire even passes XC mountain bike standards in testing.",
